       }
      ],
      "text": "Language/communication:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " waves “bye-bye”; calls a parent “mama” or “dada” or another special name; understands “no” (pauses briefly or stops when you say it)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
